'''Nahagliiv''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon|dragon]] buried in a [[Skyrim:Dragon Mounds|dragon mound]] atop a hill, just southwest of [[Skyrim:Rorikstead|Rorikstead]]. He is one of several named dragons that [[SR:Alduin|Alduin]] resurrects throughout the course of the [[SR:Main Quest|main quest]].

He will be resurrected by Alduin and appear in the skies near Rorikstead once the player reaches the stage 60 of [[Skyrim:Alduin's Wall|Alduin's Wall]], but will not attack the town until you arrive to face him.

Nahagliiv's name translates to "Fury Burn Wither."

